Date: Wed, 27 Dec 2017 15:56:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] add support for USB pass through device on GVM

Add defconfig and driver changes to support USB
as a pass through device on GVM for MSM8996

Change-Id: Id1e9f0467bcce96ba0cca61a3844d222659fef55
Signed-off-by: Ramachandran Venkataramani <ramavenk@codeaurora.org>
Signed-off-by: Yimin Peng <yiminp@codeaurora.org>
